{"author":["Elastic"],"building_block_type":"default","description":"检测构建块：已弃用Exchange传输代理安装脚本。对应需求：持久化。官方：Deprecated - Microsoft Exchange Transport Agent Install Script。","from":"now-119m","index":["winlogbeat-*","logs-windows.powershell*"],"interval":"60m","language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】构建块：已弃用Exchange传输代理安装脚本","risk_score":21,"rule_id":"846fe13f-6772-4c83-bd39-9d16d4ad1a81","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 按规则数据源接入对应日志（终端、云、身份或网络）。\n2. 构建块规则用于关联，确认数据流有数据后再评估。\n","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 持久化","来源: 默认","对应需求: 持久化"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"query","query":"event.category: \"process\" and host.os.type:windows and\n  powershell.file.script_block_text : (\n    (\n    \"Install-TransportAgent\" or\n    \"Enable-TransportAgent\"\n    )\n  ) and\n  not user.id : \"S-1-5-18\" and\n  not powershell.file.script_block_text : (\n    \"'Install-TransportAgent', 'Invoke-MonitoringProbe', 'Mount-Database', 'Move-ActiveMailboxDatabase',\" or\n    \"'Enable-TransportAgent', 'Enable-TransportRule', 'Export-ActiveSyncLog', 'Export-AutoDiscoverConfig',\" or\n    (\"scriptCmd.GetSteppablePipeline\" and \"ForwardHelpTargetName Install-TransportAgent\")\n  )\n","filters":[{"meta":{"negate":true},"query":{"wildcard":{"file.path":{"case_insensitive":true,"value":"?:\\\\Users\\\\*\\\\AppData\\\\Roaming\\\\Microsoft\\\\Exchange\\\\RemotePowerShell\\\\*"}}}},{"meta":{"negate":true},"query":{"wildcard":{"file.path":{"case_insensitive":true,"value":"?:\\\\Users\\\\*\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\tmp_????????.???\\\\tmp_????????.???.ps?1"}}}},{"meta":{"negate":true},"query":{"wildcard":{"file.path":{"case_insensitive":true,"value":"?:\\\\Windows\\\\TEMP\\\\tmp_????????.???\\\\tmp_????????.???.ps?1"}}}},{"meta":{"negate":true},"query":{"wildcard":{"file.path":{"case_insensitive":true,"value":"?:\\\\Users\\\\*\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\Temp\\\\*\\\\tmp_????????.???\\\\tmp_????????.???.ps?1"}}}}],"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1505","name":"Server Software Component","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1505/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1505.002","name":"Transport Agent","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1505/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.001","name":"PowerShell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"related_integrations":[{"package":"windows","version":"*"}],"note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n构建块：已弃用Exchange传输代理安装脚本\n\n### 为何重要\n在重启或登录后保持立足点\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","cloud.account.id","process.name","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","event.action","message"]},"version":111,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
